sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant API as API / job entry point
    participant Place as PlaceOrderCommand
    participant Create as CreateOrderCommand
    participant Reserve as ReserveStockCommand
    API->>+Place: Dispatch through command pipeline
    Note over Place,Reserve: Nested commands use their wrapped handlers / command pipeline
    Place->>+Create: Create order
    Create-->>-Place: Order ID or error
    alt Order created
        Place->>+Reserve: Reserve stock for Order ID
        Reserve-->>-Place: Result or error
    else Creation failed
        Note over Place: Skip reservation and report failure
    end
    Place-->>-API: One process result or error
    Note over API: Map the outcome; no business sequencing here
    Note over Place,Reserve: With unit of work attached, nested local writes join it; external effects need a consistency design
